key\", \"description\": \"Une clé magnifique taillée dans un cristal translucide. Elle semble ouvrir quelque chose d\'important.\"}], \"currentRoom\": \"secret-chamber\", \"elapsedTime\": 100, \"attemptsCount\": 0, \"gameCompleted\": true, \"solvedPuzzles\": [], \"unlockedRooms\": [\"secret-chamber\"], \"artifactUnlocked\": true, \"computerUnlocked\": true, \"periodicTableUnlocked\": false, \"microscopeEnigmeResolved\": false}','2025-06-27 09:42:38','2025-06-27 09:44:20'),(227,29,'2025-06-27 09:45:10',830,1719,0,'{\"score\": 830, \"hintsUsed\": 0, \"inventory\": [{\"id\": \"laboratory-key\", \"name\": \"Clé du laboratoire\", \"type\": \"key\", \"description\": \"Une clé ancienne qui ouvre la porte du laboratoire.\"}], \"currentRoom\": \"laboratory\", \"elapsedTime\": 1719, \"attemptsCount\": 0, \"gameCompleted\": false, \"solvedPuzzles\": [], \"unlockedRooms\": [\"library\", \"laboratory\"], \"artifactUnlocked\": false, \"computerUnlocked\": false, \"periodicTableUnlocked\": false, \"microscopeEnigmeResolved\": false}','2025-06-27 09:45:10','2025-06-27 10:22:40');
